# Explicit local handoff scratch; never commit transfer artifacts.
_to_delete/
# Bundles and patch series used to move work between checkouts. `patches/` held 27 MB of
# these — including a 12.4 MB patch that base64-encoded the BallZ18 sky PNGs, which are also
# in public/ and also in the commits the patch series reproduced. Every one of its 24 patches
# was checked against history before removal; all 24 were already there. Transfer artifacts
# are a delivery mechanism, not source, and git already stores the thing they were carrying.
patches/
*.patch
*.bundle
# Local scene-store data: scenes are content, not source.
.graphysx-store/
*.log
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
